Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.35,1:20:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Know them?\NI know these people\Nin my goddamn blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.39,1:20:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that\Nword around here.\NYou'll get them excited.
