Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.52,1:20:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The most efficient\Nway for us to do this\Nis for each one of us
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.15,1:20:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,to try and attempt\Nto imagine what it is like
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.74,1:20:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,inside of the possessed\Nmind of the addict.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.99,1:20:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
