Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.43,1:20:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be crazy on acid\Nto think a joint looks like\Na goddamn cockroach.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.98,1:21:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...you will notice that\Nl have distinguished four...
